<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>You Freak Me Out</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Girls Aloud</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sound Of The Underground</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3lA9WRY0EWHwxXtlZORnOR</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Tim Powell"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Miranda Cooper"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Brian Higgins"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Xenomania"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Lene"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sarah:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You hate the way I'm always watching videos</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nadine:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">11:30 and you just can't sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You think whatever I've got playing on my stereo</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cheryl:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is so pathetic that it makes you weep</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sarah:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And the beat goes on when I get back home</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cheryl:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I run straight past you to the telephone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nicola:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And my feet don't fit in your sensible shoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But you just won't quit 'til you've killed my groove</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And woo, it freaks me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've got to scream, I've got to shout</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Woo, it freaks me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like Halloween, I've got no doubt</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kimberley:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I think you're weird it's written on your resumé</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cheryl:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You say I'm stupid and my best friend too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cheryl and Nicola:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And if I smile you think I'm doing it to get my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nadine:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And if I don't I've got an attitude</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sarah:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And the beat goes on when I get back home</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cheryl:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I run straight past you to the telephone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nicola:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And my feet don't fit in your sensible shoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But you just won't quit 'til you've killed my groove</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All:</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And woo, it freaks me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've got to scream, I've got to shout</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Woo, it freaks me out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like Halloween, I've got no doubt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(repeat x3)</p></div></body></tt>